// added by tests/scenarios/run.py to td.scn, whose own trainsets were removed.
// a line of its own, away from the tracks of td.scn: 900 m level, then 6500 m down a gradient of 12 per mille,
// with no overhead wire (diesel trains). the train starts on the level with its head 10 m before the W4 of Gora and runs on
// the timetable {{timetable}} (no stop; a freight train leaves Gora at once) at its line limit, down to the signal hl_sem
// at stop 6000 m down the gradient. the line goes on 500 m past the signal
